            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A sensor device to be installed on an installation surface includes: a substrate including a substrate body that is disposed along the installation surface and an extension portion that extends from the substrate body in a direction away from the installation surface; and a temperature sensor that is mounted on the extension portion and that detects an ambient temperature around the sensor device.</p>
